.TH WERKMEISTER-FEATURE-LOGS 1 "" "werkmeister" "Werkmeister Manual"
.SH NAME
werkmeister\-feature\-logs \- Tail a feature's container logs
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBwerkmeister feature logs\fR <feature> [service]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
On a terminal, streams logs in real time (equivalent to \fBdocker compose logs \-f \-\-tail 100\fR); press \fBCtrl+C\fR to stop. Without one (a pipe, a script, an agent's tool call), it prints the last 100 lines of each container and returns.
.PP
.nf
.RS 4
# All services
werkmeister feature logs my\-feature

# Just frontend
werkmeister feature logs my\-feature frontend
.RE
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBwerkmeister\fR(1)
